There's nothing special about swirly potions. The other two sometimes 
have something... or someone in them. What type of creature might live 
in a smoky bottle?

> I imagine that barbarians wouldn't be very good at writing, say, a
> spellbook of identify.  Is there anything I should know before
> attempting this?  Is there a spellbook flavor a barbarian should prefer
> to write or obtain?

As you would imagine, barbarians just aren't to good with magic. They 
have some skill with attack spells, and they also have a special bonus 
the spell "Haste Self". However only wizards have much chance of writing 
a spellbook they haven't read before.

